      "created_at": "2019-03-20T22:35:38Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-03-20T22:35:38Z",
      "body": "I would worry that having the plugin automatically augment the privacy policy would take control out of the hands of the Journal Manager, i.e. they wouldn't be able to arrange or modify the content how they liked (without modifying the code). My preference would be to put this into the documentation along with some suggested wording.",
