      "created_at": "2019-04-12T23:54:08Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-04-12T23:54:08Z",
      "body": "Alternately, what about facilitating the JM linking from the journal's privacy policy to a plugin-managed page that states the *plugin's* policy? If the JM is happy with the default wording, they just link to it; if not, they modify the link or insert their own text directly. (We could drive ourselves mad writing tools for this kind of thing and still never accommodate the approach everyone wants.)",
